THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The `libs/` directory contains prebuilt native libraries used by the optional
OpenSlide-based connector (e.g. libopenslide, cairo, glib, freetype, libjpeg,
libpng, openjpeg and their dependencies). These are third-party components
distributed under their own respective licenses (LGPL/MIT/zlib/BSD and others).
They are included only for runtime convenience; their licenses govern their use
and redistribution. See https://openslide.org/ for details.
